e game is played from a third-person perspective in which the camera trails behind Crash, though some levels showcase forward-scrolling and side-scrolling perspectives. Crash is able to defeat enemies by either jumping on them or using a spinning attack that launches them.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/crash-bandicoot", "videos": [{"id": 155869, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "_icFmjRkDKA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_icFmjRkDKA", "title": "Crash Bandicoot [PS1] - The first 10 minutes", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_icFmjRkDKA/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 155870, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "x9IfcJiN4T0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x9IfcJiN4T0", "title": "Crash Bandicoot DEMO - PSX / PS1 - 16:9 Widescreen", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/x9IfcJiN4T0/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 155871, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "rp9VFbuQGck", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rp9VFbuQGck", "title": "Crash Bandicoot for Playstation One Commercial (1996)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rp9VFbuQGck/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 268, "name": "Crash Bandicoot"}]}